    "subtitle": "Xiteji xa nkoka xa Afrika lexi yimisiweke eka swiikhiti swa mali, lexi pfumelelaka ku tshama mali hi ku olova eka swiikhiti swa Afrika, hi nkarhi wa sweswi naswona hi switirhisiwa hinkwaswo swa swiprofexinali.",
    "mission": {
      "title": "Phetomisso ya Hina",
      "description1": "PENDO yi cinca ndlela yo nghena eka swiikhiti swa mali ya Afrika hikuva yi nyika xiteji xa kisimanjemange, lexi fikelekanaka naswona lexi hlayisekeke eka vona vatshama mali.",
      "description2": "Hi endla leswaku vatshama vamsimeke va kota ku nghena eka minkarhi yo tshama mali eka Afrika hikuva hi pfumelela munhu na munhu ku nghena eka minkarhi yo tshama mali eka swiikhiti swa Afrika, kusuka Lagos kuya Johannesburg, hi ku hundza Abidjan na Nairobi."
    },
